Package: NowcastPulse
Type: Package
Title: A Comprehensive Nowcasting Framework for Economic Indicators
Version: 0.1.7
Authors@R: c(
    person("NowcastPulse Advisory Group", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "contact@nowcastpulse.com")
  )
Description: Provides a full nowcasting pipeline including data transformation,
    variable selection, multiple modelling approaches (Bridge, PCA, 3PRF, DFM,
    Elastic Net, XGBoost, Random Forest), out-of-sample evaluation, and
    reporting utilities. Designed for mixed-frequency macroeconomic data.
